        "step_number": 1,
        "text": "Step 1: Recall the definitions of even and odd functions.\n- A function \\( h(x) \\) is even if \\( h(-x) = h(x) \\) for all \\( x \\) in the domain of \\( h \\).\n- A function \\( h(x) \\) is odd if \\( h(-x) = -h(x) \\) for all \\( x \\) in the domain of \\( h \\)."
      },
