        "near_end": false,
        "prefix_token_count": 157,
        "step_number": 2,
        "text": "Step 2: Apply these definitions to \\( f(x) \\) and \\( g(x) \\).\n- Since \\( f(x) \\) is odd, we have \\( f(-x) = -f(x) \\).\n- Since \\( g(x) \\) is even, we have \\( g(-x) = g(x) \\)."
      },
      {
